[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 5. **Determine the two solutions and their relative values:**
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m    The solutions are \(a = 6\) and \(b = -2\), with \(a \geq b\). Therefore, \(2a + b = 2(6) + (-2) = 12 - 2 = 10\).
