[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m This gives us two solutions: \( k = 0 \) or \( k = 33 \). We need to check which of these values results in valid cubic polynomials \( Q_1(x) \), \( Q_2(x) \), and \( P(x) \).
