[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m    - There are no roots that are reciprocals of each other or that fit the same polynomial form, so \( k = 0 \) is not a valid solution.
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 2. If \( k = 33 \):
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m    - \( Q_1(x) = x^2 - 26x - 33 \) and \( Q_2(x) = 2x^2 - 46x + 33 \)
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m    - The roots of \( Q_1(x) \) are \( x_1 = \frac{26}{2} = 13 \) and \( x_2 = -23 \)
