[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m We will use the quadratic formula \(x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}\), where \(a = 1\), \(b = -6\), and \(c = 11\). However, it is more straightforward to factor the quadratic equation.
