[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m    - Consider the right triangle \( \triangle ABD \) where \(\angle ABD = \theta\).
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m    - The cosine rule in this context tells us that \(\cos(\theta) = \frac{A^2 + B^2 - D^2}{2AB \cdot BD}\).
