[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m Since 6 is not a multiple of 3, we consider \( |A \cap B| = 6 \):
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 100/6 = 16.67 - 1.11 = 6
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m Therefore, the number of multiples of 6 that are multiples of 2 or 3 is:
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 100/6 \times 6 = 166
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \]
