[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m Thus, the inverse of 6 modulo 7 is 6. Multiply both sides of the congruence \( 6k \equiv 2 \pmod{7} \) by 6:
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m k \equiv 2 \times 6 \pmod{7}.
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m k \equiv 12 \pmod{7}.
