[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m Substitute \( k = 7m + 5 \) back into \( x = 13k + 10 \):
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \[
