[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 2. Each correct answer scores 5 points, each incorrect answer scores -2 points, and each unanswered question scores 0 points. Frank scored 232 points in total, so we have the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m    \[
