[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m Since \( i \) must be a non-negative integer, \( 5c - 232 \) must be even. Because 5 is odd, \( 5c - 232 \) is odd if and only if \( 232 \) is even, which it is. Therefore, \( c \) must be even. Let's test even values of \( c \) to find a solution.
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m If \( c = 40 \):
[36m(main_task pid=3407)[0m \[
